      "side": 1,
      "message": "In https://buganizer.corp.google.com/issues/175663607#comment10, HOOK_INIT  in R0 runs in S5. Are the sensors really powered up in S5, or they just got power from the i2c lines?",
      "revId": "1ae0e57dc49fabd0985152fa714cffc62e97ce9f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c93cd4e1_d6f5baec",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1293891
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-22T03:18:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The sensors is powered by pp1800_sensors which is powered by EN_EC_PWR (GPIO85). I think the sensors would be powered while the EC is powered.",
      "parentUuid": "27ebc3c0_1975e17a",
      "revId": "1ae0e57dc49fabd0985152fa714cffc62e97ce9f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
