        "id": 1104704
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-22T01:32:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Once again, I would preferred the detection not to be based on scanning the i2c bus but on EC retrieving board revision/rom configuration to know which sensors are present. See https://buganizer.corp.google.com/issues/175663607#comment9.",
      "revId": "1ae0e57dc49fabd0985152fa714cffc62e97ce9f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
